   "label": "Generate Mapping from Xero Export",
   "collapsible": 1,
   "description": "No mapping list yet? Attach the Xero data export and click SharePoint > Generate Mapping. Documents are matched on date, amount and company, with the contact name and reference as tie-breakers. The result becomes this batch's Mapping File, with a Confidence column: Exact rows are imported, Review and No match rows are skipped until you change their Confidence to Confirmed."
